Z||000000||TRiAD||12-14-2001||03:41 PM||||The view out my window this morning...<P> <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0NgAAAKYTmB2KeF18xdwlEtYrOs2r59onw!RRDDnfEzchMf0*km9pwLRHbXvwUKy0Dnl8jvzJuzOYKvxDEloTGQ/snowstreet.jpg"> <P>On another note, the clutch master cylinder should be here any time, and I hope to have her on the road before the end of Monday. <P>*crossing fingers till they bleed*<P>Thanks all, for everything...<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0NgAAAMsSN*Wryq60N*CeWB!hXjfeIaMEc1YxPH9aPzaIXm!17ZpdBFE0Yk*d*dHNFG*GR3SFyLa8KJgh1IKe2Q/xmas-sig.jpg">       <BR><B><I><FONT COLOR="red">Merry Christmas!</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">Project MR1 ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</B><BR>Photoshop rendition of planned modifications<BR>AIM ~ Michael Blue 72</I></FONT>||||reg||9
