Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||12-14-2001||04:38 PM||||we got 4" in the last 2 hours, and it's still coming.. it's barely below freezing though, so it's really wet and slippery..<P>this is my first winter driving a car without a lot of torque, already slid past a street that I was trying to turn onto.. did sort of a U-turn to make the turn.. in my old car you could just stomp on the gas and power thru it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
