Z||000006||Jefrysuko||12-14-2001||08:57 PM||||You got a little more than we did here Triad.  They said 1.5 inches on the news.  It was changing from rain to sleet as I walked out the door at 7:30 but by time I made it to school (5-7 min trip) it was spitting huge flakes the size of a half dollar.  Then an hour later it was back to rain.  It just kinda feels like mother nature is playing with us.  It is supposed to be back up to 50 again tomorrow.||||reg||1
